d om er als stadhouder ervaring op te doen. Hij weet niet dat zijn rol veel verder kan reiken dan dit bestuur. Terwijl de dreiging voor het continent groeit, krijgen zijn keuzes een onverwacht gewicht. Markus Heitz begint zo een geschiedenis waarin de mogelijke redder en verwoester van een wereld niet gemakkelijk van elkaar te onderscheiden zijn.","work_id":987147057,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work6249 Schatten über Ulldart / Markus Heitz; exact Dutch Schaduwen boven Ulldart ISBN 9789024527816 Hardcover. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-034.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p310880440"],"reference":"work:6249","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-034.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL9068501W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p310880440"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789024527816","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_source_failure_no_retry","coverId":11709700,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:37.000Z","editionKey":"/books/OL33029000M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrar