e tempel van Abu Simbel te verplaatsen voordat het water van de nieuwe dam stijgt. Zij kijkt als plantenliefhebber anders naar de wereld die dreigt te verdwijnen. Een verlies brengt hen later uit elkaar. Terug in Canada raken hun herinneringen verbonden met andere verhalen over verwoesting en herstel. Anne Michaels onderzoekt hoe het bewaren van plaatsen en het vasthouden van een liefde beide op grenzen kunnen stuiten.","work_id":987147060,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work6344 The Winter Vault / Anne Michaels; exact Dutch Het wintergewelf ISBN 9789023440512 Hardcover. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-034.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p318230607"],"reference":"work:6344","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-034.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL14955254W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p318230607"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789023440512","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15231287,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:37.000Z","editionKey":"/books/OL32377987M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"origin